{"ID":"20240506110114-u5wph4p","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506110114-u5wph4p","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506110114-u5wph4p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506110114-mct2848\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614092152-dvutgda\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1028,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614092306-z9y201a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:8\u0026#125;","title":"355苦瓠（苦壶卢、苦葫芦）","type":"doc","updated":"20240828102402"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240828102402-re171ij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828102402-re171ij","updated":"20240828102402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 617px;","style":"width: 607px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"苦瓠 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/苦瓠 2-20240828102226-gd9wg28.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 607px;\" parent-style=\"width: 617px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 592px;","style":"width: 582px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"苦葫芦5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/苦葫芦5-20240703181856-ibwurtp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 582px;\" parent-style=\"width: 592px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828102356-4n29ivy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828102356-4n29ivy","updated":"20240828102356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 624px;","style":"width: 614px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"苦葫芦花6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/苦葫芦花6-20240703182251-zp7g6kz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 614px;\" parent-style=\"width: 624px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 623px;","style":"width: 613px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"苦葫芦2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/苦葫芦2-20240703181012-4nbwqcq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 613px;\" parent-style=\"width: 623px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828102337-28qr9mr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828102337-28qr9mr","updated":"20240828102342"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 575px;","style":"width: 565px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"苦瓠 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/苦瓠 3-20240828102337-rm2mm8d.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 565px;\" parent-style=\"width: 575px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"苦瓠 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/苦瓠 1-20240828102139-6wy77dx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240703180621-khwerh4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240703180621-khwerh4","updated":"20240828102239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 1212px;","style":"width: 1202px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"苦葫芦3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/苦葫芦3-20240703181137-jve259c.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 1202px;\" parent-style=\"width: 1212px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240614092149-6pmeeah","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614092149-6pmeeah"}},{"ID":"20240614092158-ghtt1mj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614092158-ghtt1mj","updated":"20240614092201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦瓠《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614092158-x34vdxs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092158-x34vdxs","updated":"20240614092158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092158-t8u0ahg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092158-t8u0ahg","updated":"20240614092158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主大水，面目四肢浮肿，下水，令人吐。生川泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092158-8pv26zz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092158-8pv26zz","updated":"20240614092158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生晋地。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092158-2brcuex","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092158-2brcuex","updated":"20240614092158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：瓠匏，匏瓠也。《广雅》云：匏瓠也。《尔雅》云：瓠栖瓣。《毛诗》云：瓠有苦叶。《传》云：匏谓之瓠，又九月断壶。《传》云：壶瓠也。古今注云：瓠，壶芦也，壶芦，瓠之无柄者，瓠，有柄者。又云：瓢瓠也，其曰匏，瓠则别名。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092208-li3t3bz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614092208-li3t3bz"}},{"ID":"20240614092209-jhsxy45","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614092209-jhsxy45","updated":"20240614092214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦瓠《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614092209-4pz90qq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092209-4pz90qq","updated":"20240614092209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，寒，有毒。主大水，面目四肢浮肿，下水，令人吐。生晋地川泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092209-adog7hr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092209-adog7hr","updated":"20240614092209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓠与冬瓜，气类同辈，而有上下之殊，当是为其苦者耳。今瓠自忽有苦者如胆，不可食，非亦是瓠类，小者名瓢，食之乃胜瓠。凡此等，皆利水道，所以在夏月食之，大理自不及冬瓜矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092209-yzluxn9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092209-yzluxn9","updated":"20240614092209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕瓠与冬瓜、瓠 ，全非类例，今此论性，都是苦瓠耳。陶谓瓠中苦者，大误矣。瓠中苦者，不入药用。冬瓜自依前说，瓠 与瓠，又须辨之。此三物苗叶相似，而实形亦有异。瓠味皆甜，时有苦者，而似越瓜，长者尺余，头尾相似。其瓠 形状，大小非一。瓠，夏中便熟，秋末并枯；瓠 夏末始实，秋中方熟，取其为器，经霜乃堪。瓠与甜瓠 ，体性相类，但味甘冷，通利水道，止渴，消热，无毒，多食令人吐。苦瓠 为疗，一如经说；然瓠苦者不堪食，无所主疗，不入方用。而甜瓠 与瓠子，啖之俱胜冬瓜，陶言不及，乃是未悉。此等元种名别，非甘者变为而苦也。其苦瓠 ，味苦，冷，有毒。主水肿、石淋，吐呀嗽，囊结，疰蛊，淡饮。或服之过分，令人吐利不止者，宜以黍穣灰汁解之。又煮汁渍阴，疗小便不通也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092219-yj6k95c","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614092219-yj6k95c"}},{"ID":"20240614092220-pqvoe5c","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614092220-pqvoe5c","updated":"20240614092224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦瓠《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240614092220-14iwudj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092220-14iwudj","updated":"20240614092220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名苦匏。即苦壶卢。凡用须择细理莹净无翳者。乃佳。不尔有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092220-pogja8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092220-pogja8c","updated":"20240614092220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓤及子"}]},{"ID":"20240614092220-kqazw2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092220-kqazw2c","updated":"20240614092220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味苦寒。有毒。治大水面目四肢浮肿。及黄胆肿满。利石淋。疗小便不通。治偏通鼻塞。黄胆肿满。苦壶卢瓤如大枣许。以童便二合。浸之一时。取两酸枣大。纳两深吸气。待黄水出良。大水胀满。头面洪大。用莹净苦瓠白瓤。捻如豆粒。以面裹煮空心服七枚。至午当出水一斗。二日水自出不止。大瘦乃瘥。二年内忌咸物。石水腹肿肢皆削瘦。用苦瓠膜炒一两。杏仁半两炒去皮尖。为末。糊丸小豆大。每饮下十丸。日水下止。小便不通。胀急者。苦瓠子三十枚炒。蝼蛄三个焙。为末。每冷水服一钱。风痛。苦壶膜取汁。以苇管灌入鼻中。其气上冲脑门。须臾恶涎流下。其病立愈。除根。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092220-sa87yf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092220-sa87yf8","updated":"20240614092220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"昏晕为疑。干者浸汁亦效。其子为末。吹入亦效。年久头风皆愈。肉血翳。秋取小柄或小药壶卢。阴干。于紧小处锯断。内挖一小孔。如眼孔大。将眼皮上下挣开。取壶定。初虽甚痛苦。然瘀肉血翳皆渐下。不伤睛也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092220-4cjhdo1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092220-4cjhdo1","updated":"20240614092220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕壶卢有甘苦二种。甘者大。苦者小。其质白色。而花亦白。但甘平与苦寒。味绝不同华而如何故本经专主治水。而仲景治皮水用之。苏恭利石淋。及小便不通。皆用之。至方书又以治头风鼻塞。所云惟苦至地。何以更能上行乎。曰。此正肺金之气化。能与足太阳合化之元机也。阳虽自下而上。然天气之自上而下者。则心肺主之。即如纳鼻吸气以治黄胆肿满。取汁灌鼻以愈风痰头痛。此非从上气化。而合于下之水化者乎。其化血化痰饮等治。非皆水中气化。得火金之合。而无留碍者乎。夫足太阳之脉。直者入络脑。而肺气迫于鼻。足阳明之起于鼻者交中。旁纳太阳之脉。是手太阴与足太阳由上而合下以化者。固足征也。经曰。肺和则鼻能知香臭。又曰。五气入鼻。藏于心肺。心肺有病。鼻为之不利。夫心主五臭。何以属之肺。五气入鼻。又何以不专藏于肺。皆以金之不得离火故也。东垣谓金生于己。亦此义耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092254-kx1vafu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614092254-kx1vafu"}},{"ID":"20240614092255-dbay5fb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614092255-dbay5fb","updated":"20240614092259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦瓠《本草思辨录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614092255-5g3xley","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092255-5g3xley","updated":"20240614092255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大水面目四肢浮肿，因在内而证在外也，以苦瓠之瓤与子治之，则弃其外而取其内也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092255-gplcmke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092255-gplcmke","updated":"20240614092255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓤与子为一瓠之津液所储，迨其渐干渐敛，气遒力浓，炼津液为精华，以此驭人身梗化之水，自无归命投诚，一遵约束。然则瓠其何以处之，其气味则苦寒也，性则就下也，瓠既就下，而他有不就下者乎，此本经所由殿之以下水也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092239-pj524jb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614092239-pj524jb"}},{"ID":"20240614092240-dwshj6n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614092240-dwshj6n","updated":"20240614092249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦瓠《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240614092240-il717up","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092240-il717up","updated":"20240614092240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦寒。主大水。面目四肢浮肿。下水令人吐。生川泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092240-h4pod9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092240-h4pod9o","updated":"20240614092240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柔蔓弱条。凌霄秋系。其落无容。不才共济。蹄践情移。穣灰性制。肥白轮。净无翳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092240-hhm1ama","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092240-hhm1ama","updated":"20240614092240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻九畴诗。弱条柔蔓渐萦回。范诗。凌霄必有为。庄子。忧其瓠落无所容。国语。苦瓠不材。与人共济而已。汪机曰。有原种是甘变为苦者。俗谓牛马践踏之故。苏恭曰。服苦瓠过分。吐利不止者。以黍穣灰汁解之。凡用苦瓠。以细理莹净。无翳者佳。僧道衍诗。嫩瓠肥白才。陆游诗。家园瓜瓠渐轮。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092305-mq490zd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614092305-mq490zd"}},{"ID":"20240614092306-z9y201a","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614092306-z9y201a","updated":"20240614092310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦瓠《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614092306-wm2p6w5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092306-wm2p6w5","updated":"20240614092306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，寒，有毒。主大水，面目、四肢浮肿，下水，令人吐。生晋地川泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092306-3ixuik5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092306-3ixuik5","updated":"20240614092306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶瓠与冬瓜气类同辈，而有上下之殊，当是为其苦尔。今瓠自忽有苦者如胆，不可食，非别生一种也。又有瓠 （音娄），亦是瓠类，小者名瓢，食之乃胜瓠。凡此等，皆利水道，所以在夏月食之，大理自不及冬瓜也。唐本注云∶瓠与冬瓜、瓠 全非类例，今此论性，都是苦瓠 尔。陶谓瓠中苦者，大误矣。瓠中苦者，不入药用。冬瓜自根据食前说，瓠 与瓠，又须辨之。此三物苗叶相似，而实形有异，瓠味皆甜，时有苦者，而似越瓜，长者尺余，头尾相似。其瓠 ，形状大小非一。瓠，夏中便熟，秋末并枯；瓠 ，夏末始实，秋中方∶熟，取其为器，经霜乃堪。瓠与甜瓠 体性相类，但味甘冷，通利水道，止渴消热，无毒，一如《经》说，然瓠苦者不堪啖，无所主疗，不入方∶用。而甜瓠与瓠子，啖之俱胜冬瓜，陶言不及，乃是未悉。此等元种各别，非甘者变而为苦也。其苦瓠瓤，味苦，冷，有毒。主水肿，石淋，吐呀嗽，囊结，疰蛊，痰饮。或服之过分，令人吐利不止者，宜以黍穣灰汁解之。又煮汁渍阴，疗小便不通也。今按陈藏器本草云∶苦瓠，煎取汁，滴鼻中出黄水，去伤寒，鼻塞，黄胆。又取一枚，开口，以水煮中搅取汁，滴鼻中煮令热，解开熨小儿闪癖。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本注云∶陶云瓠小者名瓢，按《切韵》瓢，注云∶瓠也。又语曰∶吾岂匏瓜也哉，是则此为瓜匏之瓠也。今据瓜匏少见有苦者。谨按瓠，固匏也。但匏字合作 ，盖音同字异尔，且 似瓠，可为饮器。有甘、苦二种∶甘者大；苦者小。则陶云∶小者名瓢是也，今人以苦人吐。此又与上说正同尔。《药性论》云∶苦瓠瓤，使。治水浮肿，面目肢节肿胀，下大水气疾。孟诜云∶瓠，冷。主消渴，恶疮。又，患香港脚及虚胀，冷气人不可食之，尤甚。又压热，服丹石人方∶可食，余人不可辄食。日华子云∶瓠，无毒，又云微毒。除烦止渴，治心热，利小肠，润心肺，治石淋，吐蛔虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092306-jr16xl1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092306-jr16xl1","updated":"20240614092306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"圣惠方∶治龋齿疼痛。用葫芦半升，水五升，煮取三升，去滓，含漱吐之。茎、叶亦可用，不过二剂瘥。又方∶治鼠 。用瓠花曝干为末，敷之。外台秘要∶治卒患肿满。曾有人忽脚跌，肿渐上至膝，足不可践地，主大水，头面遍身大肿胀满。苦瓠白瓤实，捻如大豆粒，以面裹，煮一沸，空心服七枚。至午当出水一斗。二日水自出不止，大瘦乃瘥。三年内慎口味也。苦瓠须好者，无靥翳，细理，研净者，不尔，有毒不用。千金方∶治眼暗。取七月七日苦瓠瓤白，绞取汁一合，以酢一升，古钱七文，和渍，微火煎之减半。以沫纳眼 中，神验。肘后方∶皆如烂肝者。苦瓠一枚，水二升，煮取一升服，立吐即愈。又方∶神验。孙真人甜瓠，患脚肿气及虚肿者，食之永不瘥。伤寒类要∶治浸之三、两食顷。取两酸枣许，分纳两鼻中子白瓤子熬令黄，捣为末，每服半钱匕，日一服，十日愈。用瓠 有吐者，当先详之。丹房镜源∶苦瓠煮汞。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092229-lj95rkh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614092229-lj95rkh"}},{"ID":"20240614092230-pozh3so","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614092230-pozh3so","updated":"20240614092235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦瓠《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240614092230-4jytv7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092230-4jytv7j","updated":"20240614092230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"即细颈葫芦"}]},{"ID":"20240614092230-nfwgtwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092230-nfwgtwn","updated":"20240614092230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦寒，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092230-c5pkzrd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092230-c5pkzrd","updated":"20240614092230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》治大水，面目四肢浮肿，下水，令人吐。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092230-3fubbax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092230-3fubbax","updated":"20240614092230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓠有甜苦二种。甜者虽言无毒，亦不利人。扁鹊云，患脚虚胀者不得食之，患永不瘥。苦者尤伤胃气，不可轻试。凡苦寒药皆能伐胃，不独瓠也。《本经》治大水浮肿，又云下水，令人吐，大伤中气。今人治黄瘅水气，大小便不通。或浸火酒饭上蒸，或实糖霜存性，必暴病实证庶可劫之。若久病胃虚误服，必致吐利不止，往往致毙，可不慎欤。其子煎汁或酒浸，治鼻窒气塞，少少滴入。又目疾 肉血翳药中亦有用者，取苦寒以降火也。长柄胡芦烧灰存性，腋下瘿瘤研末擦之，以愈为度。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092149-swxqpg9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614092149-swxqpg9"}},{"ID":"20240614092150-kgru4hr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20240614092150-kgru4hr","updated":"20240614092150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦瓠"}]},{"ID":"20240614092150-otb17wd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092150-otb17wd","updated":"20240614092150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」苦瓠、匏瓜。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092150-wfradby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092150-wfradby","updated":"20240614092150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」（瓤、子）苦、寒、有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092150-30o4ih8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092150-30o4ih8","updated":"20240614092150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240614092150-107qvmq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092150-107qvmq","updated":"20240614092150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、黄疸肿满。有苦瓠瓤如在枣大小，泡童便中一时，取出两小团塞鼻孔中，深吸气。有黄水排出，几次后即愈。又方：用瓠瓤熬黄为末，每服半钱，一天服一次，十天病愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092150-5bfc754","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092150-5bfc754","updated":"20240614092150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、水肿，头面肿大。有好苦瓠白瓤，分捻如豆粒，以面裹住煮开。空心服七枚，当有水排出，人转瘦好愈。二年内忌咸物。又方：用苦瓠瓤一两，微炒，研末。每天服一钱，稀饭送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092150-la4neix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092150-la4neix","updated":"20240614092150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、通身水肿。用苦瓠末（炒）二两、苦苈五分，捣烂合成丸子，发啵豆大。每服五丸，一天服三次，有水排出为止。又方：用苦瓠末五分、大枣七枚，合捣成丸。先服三丸，隔一小时左右，再服三丸，有水排出后更服一丸。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092150-a8r525f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092150-a8r525f","updated":"20240614092150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、小便不通。有革瓠子三十枚（炒）、蝼蛄三个（焙），共研为末。每服一钱，冷水送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092150-ritz8nl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092150-ritz8nl","updated":"20240614092150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、风痰头痛。取苦瓠膜汁，以苇管灌入鼻中，有气上冲脑门，不久恶涎流下，病即愈。如在治疔过程中出现头晕现象，不用疑忌。有干苦瓠膜浸汁，或用苦瓠子研末，入鼻中亦有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092150-94qb171","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092150-94qb171","updated":"20240614092150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、牙痛。用壶卢子半升，加水五升煎成三升，含漱。和茎叶煎汁含漱亦可。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092150-vbsrpw9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092150-vbsrpw9","updated":"20240614092150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、恶疮癣癞。用苦瓠一枚煮汁涂搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092150-p4v1uyh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092150-p4v1uyh","updated":"20240614092150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、痔疮肿痛。用苦壶卢、苦荬煎汤，先薰后洗。洗后以熊胆、密陀僧、胆矾、片脑合研为末，敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092150-9yyobvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092150-9yyobvw","updated":"20240614092150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、耳出脓。有干瓠子一分、黄连半钱，共研为末。先耳揩净，末少许入耳。一天二次"}]},{"ID":"20240614092150-nddznvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092150-nddznvr","updated":"20240614092150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10、一切瘘疮。用霜后收采和晒干的苦瓠花研为末，敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092151-88ilrcg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614092151-88ilrcg"}},{"ID":"20240614092152-dvutgda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092152-dvutgda"}}]}